window.FIXTURES=window.FIXTURES||{};window.FIXTURES["speech"]={"vid":"1EnrCqI_BWE","speaker":"Nikol Pashinyan","role":"Prime Minister","country":"Armenia","region":"Asia-Pacific","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1EnrCqI_BWE","date":"20260924","title":"🇦🇲 Armenia - Prime Minister Addresses United Nations General Debate, 81st Session | #UNGA","seconds":1043,"words":1862,"counts":{"claims":27,"promises":2,"attacks":0},"topics":[{"topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace","share":0.2683,"seconds":280},{"topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan transport","share":0.2435,"seconds":254},{"topic":"Armenia reconstruction","share":0.0868,"seconds":91},{"topic":"Armenia elections","share":0.0865,"seconds":90},{"topic":"Armenia neighbors","share":0.0806,"seconds":84},{"topic":"Armenia EU relations","share":0.065,"seconds":68},{"topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan relations","share":0.0595,"seconds":62},{"topic":"Armenia US relations","share":0.058,"seconds":60},{"topic":"Armenia climate","share":0.0517,"seconds":54}],"timeline":[[1,74,"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace"],[76,138,"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace"],[139,199,"Armenia US relations"],[204,284,"Armenia-Azerbaijan transport"],[286,376,"Armenia-Azerbaijan transport"],[376,461,"Armenia-Azerbaijan transport"],[462,553,"Armenia reconstruction"],[553,643,"Armenia elections"],[644,706,"Armenia-Azerbaijan relations"],[707,790,"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace"],[793,854,"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace"],[855,923,"Armenia EU relations"],[925,1009,"Armenia neighbors"],[1012,1066,"Armenia climate"]],"stances":{"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace":"Nikol Pashinyan states that peace between Armenia and Azerbaijan was established on August 8, 2025 with the support of US President Donald Trump.","Armenia US relations":"Nikol Pashinyan states that the implementation of the Trip connectivity project is becoming reality and confirms determination to pursue it in good faith.","Armenia-Azerbaijan transport":"Nikol Pashinyan outlines the equity structure of a new transportation development company and links it to the implementation of a peace declaration signed with Azerbaijan.","Armenia reconstruction":"Nikol Pashinyan states that the TRIP project promises great benefits and serves as a cornerstone for long-term stability and peace in the region.","Armenia elections":"Nikol Pashinyan states that democratic reforms ensured resilience against external attempts to seize the state and allowed voters to choose peace.","Armenia-Azerbaijan relations":"Nikol Pashinyan states that Armenia is ready to deepen cooperation with Azerbaijan on demining and the return of detained Armenians, while criticizing the use of conflict rhetoric by both sides.","Armenia EU relations":"Nikol Pashinyan states that the European Commission's approval of autonomous trade measures demonstrates a new quality in Armenia-EU relations and notes that relations with Russia are transforming due to the establishment of peace.","Armenia neighbors":"Nikol Pashinyan states that normalizing and deepening relations with neighboring countries is a key priority for Armenia's foreign policy.","Armenia climate":"Nikol Pashinyan announces that Armenia will host the 17th Conference of the Parties to the Convention on Biological Diversity in October and invites international participation."},"claims":[{"t":48,"quote":"the peace between Armenia and Azerbaijan established on August 8, 2025 with the support and personal engagement of US President Donald Trump has opened up new opportunities for our region","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace","kind":"fact"},{"t":111,"quote":"The fourth paragraph of the peace declaration adopted at the peace summit held at the White House on August 8, 2025 reads, quote, \"The Republic of Armenia will work with the United States of America and mutually determined third parties to set forth a framework for the Trump route for international peace and prosperity.\"","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace","kind":"fact"},{"t":168,"quote":"The framework agreement on strategic on the Trump route for international peace and prosperity project signed between Armenia and the United States of will soon be ratified by the National Assembly of the Republic of Armenia.","topic":"Armenia US relations","kind":"fact"},{"t":189,"quote":"We are currently working with the United States government to establish the trip development company and to sign a shareholders agreement.","topic":"Armenia US relations","kind":"fact"},{"t":204,"quote":"Armenia will initially have a 26% stake in the trip development company and the United States will have a 74% stake.","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan transport","kind":"number"},{"t":215,"quote":"The agreement provides that in the event of its extension in the 50th year, the Republic of Armenia's share will become without additional investment.","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan transport","kind":"fact"},{"t":231,"quote":"One of the practical expressions of the trip project will be the implementation of paragraph 3 of the peace declaration adopted by me and the president of Azarbaijan on August 8, 2025 and signed by the United States president as a witness.","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan transport","kind":"fact"},{"t":314,"quote":"For the first time since the early 90s, Armenia will get railway connection with Azerbaijan and thus also with Russia, Central Asia and China.","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan transport","kind":"fact"},{"t":331,"quote":"after the peace summit on August 8, Azerbaijan opened its railway to And now we have a railway connection with Azerbaijan via the territory of Georgia.","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan transport","kind":"fact"},{"t":379,"quote":"While Azerbaijan does not have a railway connection with its Nakivan Autonomous Republic and this is in practice possible only via the territory of Armenia.","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan transport","kind":"fact"},{"t":412,"quote":"we are waiting for the opening of the Armenia Turkey railway together with the trip project.","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan transport","kind":"fact"},{"t":488,"quote":"After almost 35 years of conflict, we are now discussing issues of building power lines and roads in addition to the east west railway within the framework of the trip project.","topic":"Armenia reconstruction","kind":"fact"},{"t":537,"quote":"the Washington peace summit on August 8","topic":"Armenia reconstruction","kind":"fact"},{"t":546,"quote":"the parliamentary election held on June 7 of this year","topic":"Armenia reconstruction","kind":"fact"},{"t":553,"quote":"of voters voted in favor of the slogan own up the peace enabling the civil contract party to form a parliamentary majority.","topic":"Armenia elections","kind":"fact"},{"t":568,"quote":"The election took place under special circumstances of external information a number of external and internal forces had developed and were implementing a plan to seize the state using mass disinformation, hybrid and other tools and applying also the distribution of mass voter bribes.","topic":"Armenia elections","kind":"fact"},{"t":644,"quote":"which we have reached an agreement to cooperate with Azerba. Armenia is ready to continue and deepen cooperation with Azerbaijan on the issue of demining.","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan relations","kind":"fact"},{"t":657,"quote":"people in the Republic of Armenia are waiting for the return of Armenians who were detained in Azerbaijan as a consequence of the conflict.","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan relations","kind":"fact"},{"t":721,"quote":"For two and a half years now, there have been no casualties or injuries as a result of crossfire between Armenia and Azerbaijan.","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace","kind":"fact"},{"t":740,"quote":"We have never had such a period in the relations between independent Armenia and independent Azerbaijan before.","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace","kind":"fact"},{"t":793,"quote":"The signing and ratification of that which was initialed at the Washington peace summit is the next major topic in the joint agenda of Armenia and Azerban","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace","kind":"fact"},{"t":833,"quote":"In recent years, we have established strategic relations with Georgia, France, China, the Netherlands, Kazakhstan, Germany, Luxembourg, the United Kingdom, Bulgaria, Croatia, Lithuania, the United States of America, and the European Union.","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace","kind":"fact"},{"t":855,"quote":"Today, by the way, the European Commission approved the decision to adopt autonomous trade measures for Armenia","topic":"Armenia EU relations","kind":"fact"},{"t":884,"quote":"throughout the entire preceding period the largest factor influencing relations between Armenia and Russia was the Armenia Azerbaijan conflict","topic":"Armenia EU relations","kind":"fact"},{"t":958,"quote":"We have a high level dialogue with Turkey","topic":"Armenia neighbors","kind":"fact"},{"t":963,"quote":"I want to confirm the words expressed by President Erdogan from this podium the other day that we are resolutely pushing forward the process of normalizing Armenia Turkey relations","topic":"Armenia neighbors","kind":"fact"},{"t":1021,"quote":"this October, Armenia will host the 17th of the parties to the convention on biological diversity, the COP 17","topic":"Armenia climate","kind":"fact"}],"promises":[{"t":388,"quote":"In the near future, we will restore the railway sections of Mei and Yas in the Republic of Armenia which existed during the Soviet Union and were later destroyed and the railway connections I mentioned will be opened.","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan transport","kind":"promise"},{"t":807,"quote":"we will consistently continue to work in this direction","topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace","kind":"promise"}],"attacks":[],"greece":[],"said":[],"pickup":[],"transcript":[{"t":1,"topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace","text":"The assembly will now hear an address by his excellency Nicole Parnan, Prime Minister of the Republic of Armenia. I request protocol to escort his excellency and invite him to address the Thank you. &gt;&gt; Honorable presidents of the 81st session of the UN General Assembly. ladies and gentlemen, the peace between Armenia and Azerbaijan established on August 8, 2025 with the support and personal engagement of US President Donald Trump has opened up new opportunities for our region, the South On this occasion, &gt;&gt; I would firstly like to address what President Trump referred to from this podium two days ago."},{"t":76,"topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace","text":"I have said it and I reiterate it now. The breakthrough in the establishment of peace between Armenia and Azerbaijan simply would not have been possible without President Trump's personal and his resolute commitment to establishing peace. President Trump's personal presence has practical and symbolic expressions on the ground as well. The fourth paragraph of the peace declaration adopted at the peace summit held at the White House on August 8, 2025 reads, quote, \"The Republic of Armenia will work with the United States of America and mutually determined third parties to set forth a framework for the Trump route for international peace and prosperity."},{"t":139,"topic":"Armenia US relations","text":"ity trip connectivity project in the territory of the Republic of Armenia. We confirm our determination to pursue efforts in good faith to achieve this goal in the most expeditious manner. End of quote. The implementation of the trip project is thus becoming reality with tangible The framework agreement on strategic on the Trump route for international peace and prosperity project signed between Armenia and the United States of will soon be ratified by the National Assembly of the Republic of Armenia. We are currently working with the United States government to establish the trip development company and to sign a shareholders agreement."},{"t":204,"topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan transport","text":"Armenia will initially have a 26% stake in the trip development company and the United States will have a 74% stake. The agreement provides that in the event of its extension in the 50th year, the Republic of Armenia's share will become without additional investment. One of the practical expressions of the trip project will be the implementation of paragraph 3 of the peace declaration adopted by me and the president of Azarbaijan on August 8, 2025 and signed by the United States president as a witness. Paragraph 3 of that declaration reads, quote, we reaffirmed the importance of the opening of communications between the two countries, meaning Armenia and Azerbaan for intrastate, bilateral and international transportation for the promotion of peace, stability and prosperity in the region and its neighborhood on the basis of respect for the sovereignty territorial integrity and the jurisdiction of states."},{"t":286,"topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan transport","text":"These efforts are to include unimpeded connectivity between the main part of the Republic of Azerbaijan and its Nakchivan Autonomous Republic through the territory of the Republic of Armenia with reciprocal benefits for international and intrastate connectivity for the Republic of Armenia. End of quote. The implementation of the trip project will be of historic importance for the Republic of Armenia. For the first time since the early 90s, Armenia will get railway connection with Azerbaijan and thus also with Russia, Central Asia and China. However, it should be emphasized that after the peace summit on August 8, Azerbaijan opened its railway to And now we have a railway connection with Azerbaijan via the territory of Georgia. The implementation of the trip project will create a direct railway connection between Armenia and Azerbaijan as well as a railway connection from Azerbaijan to Azerbaijan via the territory of Armenia and from Armenia to Armenia via the territory of Azerbaijan because Armenia does not have a railway connection between its northern and southern regions and in practice this is possible only via the territory of the Nakchivan"},{"t":376,"topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan transport","text":"Autonomous Republic of the Republic of Azerbaijan. While Azerbaijan does not have a railway connection with its Nakivan Autonomous Republic and this is in practice possible only via the territory of Armenia. In the near future, we will restore the railway sections of Mei and Yas in the Republic of Armenia which existed during the Soviet Union and were later destroyed and the railway connections I mentioned will be opened. But this will also have huge international significance because in parallel with the construction of the aforementioned railways, we are waiting for the opening of the Armenia Turkey railway together with the trip project. This could become one of the most important events in the field of international logistics in recent decades because thus a new railway connection will be opened between China, Central Asia, Turkey and the European All this opens up another crucial opportunity for international logistics because the restoration of the railway connection between Armenia and the Nakjavan Autonomous Republic of the Republic of restores the railway connection also between the Persian Gulf and the Black Sea."},{"t":462,"topic":"Armenia reconstruction","text":"This is an important nuance because it shows why and how the implementation of the trip project promises great benefits to all countries in our region and thus and these potential benefits thus become a cornerstone of long-term stability and peace especially between Armenia and After almost 35 years of conflict, we are now discussing issues of building power lines and roads in addition to the east west railway within the framework of the trip project. And this will enable not only the Republic of Armenia but also the entire south caucuses to become a crossroads of peace. Honorable presidents of the 81st session of the UN General Assembly, excellencies, ladies and gentlemen, all of this reflects the optimism that has been established in our region and in the Republic of Armenia since the Washington peace summit on August 8, The citizens of Armenia reaffirmed their optimism in the parliamentary election held on June 7 of this year &gt;&gt; where the overwhelming majority"},{"t":553,"topic":"Armenia elections","text":"of voters voted in favor of the slogan own up the peace enabling the civil contract party to form a parliamentary majority. The election took place under special circumstances of external information a number of external and internal forces had developed and were implementing a plan to seize the state using mass disinformation, hybrid and other tools and applying also the distribution of mass voter bribes. But the democratic and institutional reforms we have implemented in recent years proved their strength. Armenia's state institutions demonstrated high resilience, preventing state capture and giving the people of Armenia the opportunity to have their The people of Armenia owned up the peace and we must consistently engage in the further strengthening and institutionalization of peace in the relations between Armenia and The clarification of the fate of several thousand missing persons is a matter that needs to be addressed on"},{"t":644,"topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan relations","text":"which we have reached an agreement to cooperate with Azerba. Armenia is ready to continue and deepen cooperation with Azerbaijan on the issue of demining. And of course, people in the Republic of Armenia are waiting for the return of Armenians who were detained in Azerbaijan as a consequence of the conflict. Along with with these issues still being unresolved, another reason that fuels pessimists is the use of conflict rhetoric from time to time in certain circles of Armenia and Azerbaijan, sometimes at the official level. I think that we I mean Armenian Azerbajan have achieved more than sufficient results which should be more valuable for us than the use of conflict rhetoric whether it is about history or historical cultural monuments or anything else."},{"t":707,"topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace","text":"Nurturing the peace, strengthening and making it institutional should be the main theme of cooperation between Armenia and For two and a half years now, there have been no casualties or injuries as a result of crossfire between Armenia and Azerbaijan. And I think this is the greatest value that was created as a result of cooperation in recent years. We have never had such a period in the relations between independent Armenia and independent Azerbaijan before. Even though Armenians and Azerbaijanis have centuries of experience of peaceful coexistence. Our task, however, is not to restore that experience, but to build interstate relations on the basis of that experience of the people's based on respect for each other's territorial integrity, sovereignty, and political This, by the way, is exactly the rhetoric that Armenia and Azerbaijan have already agreed upon and initialed in the text of the agreement on establishing peace and interstate relations between the two countries."},{"t":793,"topic":"Armenia-Azerbaijan peace","text":"The signing and ratification of that which was initialed at the Washington peace summit is the next major topic in the joint agenda of Armenia and Azerban and we will consistently continue to work in this direction. Ladies and the balanced and balancing foreign policy adopted by Armenia stems from the logic of multipolarity which is one of the key principles of the United Nations. In recent years, we have established strategic relations with Georgia, France, China, the Netherlands, Kazakhstan, Germany, Luxembourg, the United Kingdom, Bulgaria, Croatia, Lithuania, the United States of America, and the European Union."},{"t":855,"topic":"Armenia EU relations","text":"Today, by the way, the European Commission approved the decision to adopt autonomous trade measures for Armenia, which is yet another manifestation of the new quality of Armenia EU relations. Our relations with Russia are in a transformation phase and this is a natural process because throughout the entire preceding period the largest factor influencing relations between Armenia and Russia was the Armenia Azerbaijan conflict. Now that we have established peace with ArmeniaRussia relations will naturally change and it is our desire that these relations develop on the basis of the principles of friendship and mutual We will of course continue to develop our relations with partners located closer to or farther from Armenia."},{"t":925,"topic":"Armenia neighbors","text":"And in this regard, I would like to highlight the countries of Central Asia with which our relations are also highly dynamic. But I also cannot but emphasize the normalization and deepening of relations with our neighbors are nevertheless of key importance for our foreign policy vision. I have already spoken about the dynamics of our relations with Azerbaijan. We have a high level dialogue with Turkey and I want to confirm the words expressed by President Erdogan from this podium the other day that we are resolutely pushing forward the process of normalizing Armenia Turkey relations. Our relations with our two other neighbors, the Islamic Republic of Iran and Georgia, remain of exceptional importance to us, and our good neighborliness continues to develop and The Republic of Armenia considers its contribution to the region's stability and development to be our key task in international peace, stability, and development."},{"t":1012,"topic":"Armenia climate","text":"Honorable President of the 81st session of the UN General Assembly, ladies and gentlemen, this October, Armenia will host the 17th of the parties to the convention on biological diversity, the COP 17, and I invite you all to participate in this very important event for Armenia and for the international biodiversity agenda. Dear ladies and gentlemen, this is what I wanted to share with you in my speech today. Thank you for your &gt;&gt; On behalf of the assembly, I wish to thank the prime minister of the Republic of Armenia,"}],"compare":[{"topic":"Armenia","share":0.1826,"mean":0.0009,"rank":1,"others":3}]};
